# .cursorrules
[environment]
os = "Fedora Linux"
desktop = "KDE Plasma"
architecture = "x86_64"
python_version = "3.11+"

[guidelines]
- Use Streamlit for the local web UI (runs fast on desktop browsers).
- Use SQLite (standard library) for local persistent pantry inventory and saved recipes.
- Provide clean, modern UI components with easy tags for pantry items, dietary preferences, and appliances (Air Fryer, Instant Pot, Oven, Stove).
- Support both Gemini API (free tier) and local Ollama endpoint (http://localhost:11434) for AI generation.
- Keep external Python dependencies light and standard.
